exports[`email catalog > invitation > matches html and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"MeetOps

Bo Lee invited you to join Acme Inc on MeetOps.

You'll join as Member.

Accept invitation: https://app.meetops.test/invite?token=demo

This invitation expires in 7 days.

--
You're receiving this security email because of activity on your MeetOps account. It can't be turned off.
"
`;

