r-spacing:-0.01em;white-space:nowrap;">MeetOps <span class="mo-link" style="color:#3AB0E0;">AI</span></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:16px;"><p class="mo-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">MeetOps AI turns meetings into reviewed, synced tasks.</p><p class="mo-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">You&#39;re receiving this security email because of activity on your MeetOps account. It can&#39;t be turned off.</p><p class="mo-muted" style="margin:0;color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12px;">&copy; MeetOps AI</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"`;

exports[`email catalog > login-lockout > matches html and text snapshots > subject 1`] = `"Sign-in temporarily locked"`;

exports[`email catalog > login-lockout > matches html and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"MeetOps

Hi Ana,

We locked sign-in to your account for 15 minutes after several failed attempts.

If this wasn't you, reset your password now.

Reset password: https://app.meetops.test/reset-password?token=demo

--
You're receiving this security email because of activity on your MeetOps account. It can't be turned off.
"
`;

