e="padding:14px 0 14px 16px;border-top:1px solid #2A2A2E;"><span class="mo-link" style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;line-height:22px;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;background-color:#0B2531;color:#3AB0E0;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;">5</span></td><td valign="top" style="padding:14px 16px 14px 12px;border-top:1px solid #2A2A2E;"><p class="mo-text" style="margin:0;color:#F5F5F7;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">Write runbook</p></td></tr><tr><td width="28" valign="top" style="padding:14px 0 14px 16px;border-top:1px solid #2A2A2E;"><span class="mo-link" style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;line-height:22px;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;background-color:#0B2531;color:#3AB0E0;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;">6</span></td><td valign="top" style="padding:14px 16px 14px 12px;border-top:1px solid #2A2A2E;"><p class="mo-text" style="margin:0;color:#F5F5F7;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;">…and 1 more</p></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 28px;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#007BA7" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#007BA7;border:1px solid #3AB0E0;"><a href="https://app.meetops.test/meetings/m1/tasks/review" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;min-height:46px;line-height:46px;padding:0 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.01em;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Review tasks&nbsp;&rarr;</a></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #2A2A2E;"><tr><td style="padding-top:20px;"><p class="mo-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;">If the button doesn&#39;t work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p><a class="mo-link" href="https://app.meetops.test/meetings/m1/tasks/review" style="color:#3AB0E0;fo